</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>This code may be stored even when no malfunction is found, depending on the battery condition or the power source waveform at engine start  </ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>01-D7</ptxt>
</entry>
