<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>01-DC</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Transmission Failure</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Transmission to the device indicated by the sub-code failed (this code may not be directly related to a malfunction)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>If the device indicated by the sub-code is also stored in other devices, inspect the power source system and AVC-LAN communication system W/H of the device indicated by the sub-code  </ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>This code may be stored if the engine is started again 60 seconds after the engine was started</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
